+kore-exec .../proof-kompiled/definition.kore --module MPY-VERIFICATION --prove .../spec.kore --spec-module TOTALITY-PROBE --output .../result.kore
+exit=0
+
+$ export PATH="$HOME/.nix-profile/bin:$PATH"; kprove /audit-output/evidence/05_totality_probe.k --definition proof-kompiled --spec-module TOTALITY-PROBE -I .
+kore-exec: [221605] Warning (WarnStuckClaimState):
+    The configuration's term unifies with the destination's term, but the
+    implication check between the conditions has failed.
+Context:
+  #Not ( { false #Equals bracketSpec ( -1 , ")" ) } )
