+        "count" |-> intVal ( 0 )
+      </env>
+    </mpy>
+[Error] Prover: backend terminated because the configuration cannot be
+rewritten further. See output for more details.
+exit=1
+
+Witness: input "" satisfies the ordinary empty-map entry state.  Trusted
+canonical Python, generated Python, and fresh LLVM semantics all return true.
+The mutation changes only the destination to boolVal(false).  It parses/builds,
+executes the real solutionProgram, reaches boolVal(true), and fails at exactly
+the false result obligation.
